    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051104.0092\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 4 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nRussian prime minister ends China visit\n\n\n\n\nRussian Prime Minister Mikhail Yefimovich Fradkov left Beijing on Friday afternoon, ending his official visit to China.\n\nDuring his stay in Beijing, Fradkov and his Chinese counterpart Wen Jiabao held the 10th Sino-Russian Prime Ministers' Meeting.\n\nAt the invitation of Chinese Premier Wen Jiabao, Fradkov paid an official visit to China November 3-4.",
